**Acceptance criteria:**

- Implement `kvist prompt [PROMPT]` command supporting options: `--role`, `--idle-timeout`, `--detect-loops`, and `--max-restarts`.
- Accept bounded nonblank UTF-8 prompts from positional text, `--file`, redirected
